cene_forward_mobile.glsl:\n  1016  #ifdef MODE_RENDER_MATERIAL\n  1017: \tif (alpha < compute_alpha_hash_threshold(object_pos, alpha_hash_scale)) {\n  1018  \t\talpha = 0.0;\n\n  1022  #else\n  1023: \tif (alpha < compute_alpha_hash_threshold(object_pos, alpha_hash_scale)) {\n  1024  \t\tdiscard;\n```\n\n(There are no results in `drivers/gles3/`.)","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2672716126/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2672754852","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103094#issuecomment-2672754852","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103094","id":2672754852,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6fTwCk","user":{"login":"sinni800","id":2879097,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NzkwOTc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2879097?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinni800","html_url":"https://github.com/sinni800","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinni800/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinni800/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinni800/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinni800/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinni800/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinni800/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinni800/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinni800/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sinni800/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-20T21:44:28Z","updated_at":"2025-02-20T21:44:28Z","body":"Ah, I thought that meant it was a bug, but if there was no intention to have it in the first place by now (and it's not just bugged), my opinion is that it would be a good idea to at least have cutout (hash) transparency in the engine in GL_COMPAT, as it's a cheap way to get transparency at all.\n\nNintendo uses it a lot on the Nintendo switch, which is very much a mobile platform (the current one being weaker than a lot of phones), and as a side note it's a funny development that even modern engines (Unreal) use it a lot now (and then wash over it with TAA). I know TAA isn't supported, but this pixely transparency is kind of a vibe.\n\nIt's good that it can be done anyway (through the shader I cobbled from the base code) even as long as this feature doesn't get implemented.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2672754852/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2994197730","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103094#issuecomment-2994197730","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103094","id":2994197730,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6yd9Ti","user":{"login":"ArtyIF","id":8017858,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgwMTc4NTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8017858?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArtyIF","html_url":"https://github.com/ArtyIF","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArtyIF/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArtyIF/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArtyIF/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArtyIF/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArtyIF/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArtyIF/orgs","repos_url":"https:/